-- any other use of the score in WHERE is an error that says where to filter
SELECT id FROM r WHERE body @@> 'dog' AND (sift.score(ctid) > 1 OR id = 1);
ERROR:  sift.score() must be computed by a sift scan of the same relation
HINT:  Call it on the ctid of a table with a sift index, in the query level that scans the table, with a @@> condition on the indexed column.
SELECT id FROM r WHERE body @@> 'dog' AND sift.score(ctid) = 1;
ERROR:  sift.score() must be computed by a sift scan of the same relation
HINT:  Call it on the ctid of a table with a sift index, in the query level that scans the table, with a @@> condition on the indexed column.
